{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54804","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山窄地，泣滴莫安营。\n两路中间休立寨，龙头（辛本、川本作「勿投」）天竈怎持兵，仔细与军（辛本、川本作「君」）寻。\n（天竈者，大谷之口；龙头者，大山之端。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}